{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "29ce899d-fe2d-8e35-9b31-085fd03b958d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T14:47:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin, what can I do for you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, Kevin. You got me on speaker, I'm down in the basement with a shop vac, so bear with me. Is this call being recorded?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:45:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It might be, yeah. Some of the lines are recorded for quality. That a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's fine. Honestly, good. I want somebody to hear this. Name's Luis Raposo, 9 Wellington Avenue, right up from the corner of Thames."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:45:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Luis Raposo, 9 Wellington. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:45:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So this storm, the snow that turned to rain, came in yesterday, finished up this morning. Overnight the drain at the bottom of Thames and Wellington, the low corner, totally backed up. Street was a pond. A pond, Kevin. Curb to curb. And the water had nowhere to go but my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:45:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Corner drain backed up, Thames and Wellington, street flooded... got it. And it got into the basement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:45:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Came right in the basement windows, and the window well on the street side, the glass, it just poured through there. About three inches on the floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:46:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three inches, through the windows and the street-side window well. Anything damaged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My paint cans, my ladders, all sitting in it. Workbench, my hand tools, wicked wet. I'm out here drying wrenches with a towel like an idiot. [inaudible] ...and that grate, I watch leaves pile up on it all fall, nobody ever comes by to clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out a little. Leaves on the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:46:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The grate. It's covered. I'm saying nobody touches it. You guys plow, fine, but the drain just sits there clogged and then this happens. Somebody should've been on that before a storm, not after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. So I'm putting in a drain backup for that corner, noting the flooding at your place. I can get a crew out to look at it tomorrow, Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:46:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Okay. And then what, next storm we do it all again? Can the city put a pump truck on that corner next time? Just park it there when the rain's coming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair ask. I can't approve that myself, but I'm writing it in the order, pump truck request for next storm, so the supervisor sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Write it big. Because I'm not doing this every month, Kevin. I'm seventy, I shouldn't be hauling ladders up the stairs at seven in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "House phone, 401-555-0118."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0118. All right, crew tomorrow for the corner, pump truck request noted. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just get it cleaned out. Properly. Not a rake and a wave."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll pass that along. Good luck with the drying, Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T14:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks."
    }
  ],
